  --> ./tests/cases/integers/err_implicit_narrowing.aipl:15:38
   |
15 | fn argument(n: i64) -> u8 { takes_u8(n) }
   |                                      ^

error: fn "returned": body returns u16, but the declared return type is u8 — u8 cannot hold every u16, so convert with `.narrow()`, which gives `none` when the value does not fit
